  "description": "A lightweight, flexible JSON-to-object mapper for C# that handles third-party API responses with mismatched property names and nested structures. Supports dot notation for mapping nested JSON properties (e.g., \"parent.child.property\") to flat C# objects without requiring contract definitions. Perfect for integrating with multiple external APIs.",
